            <h2>Before You Start</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Open the Schema and ERD tabs before Section 1.</li>
                <li>Write SQL in the playground, not on this page.</li>
                <li>Do Section 5 last because it changes data.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
